Brand-New Luxury Living in the Heart of Watsonia
30 KENMARE STREET, WATSONIA
30 Kenmare Street, Watsonia | 4 Bedrooms | 3 Bathrooms
Perfectly positioned in one of Watsonia’s most convenient and tightly held pockets, this brand-new street-front residence showcases exceptional craftsmanship, premium finishes and a thoughtfully designed floorplan for contemporary family living.

The flexible four-bedroom, three-bathroom layout is ideal for families, downsizers, professionals and multi-generational households. A ground-floor bedroom with its own ensuite provides outstanding versatility for elderly parents, guests, teenagers or anyone seeking single-level convenience.

At the heart of the home, the spacious open-plan living and dining area connects seamlessly with a private alfresco courtyard, creating an inviting setting for everyday relaxation and effortless entertaining. The beautifully appointed stone kitchen features Bosch appliances, premium 2-pack painted cabinetry and generous storage.

Upstairs, the luxurious master suite is complemented by two additional bedrooms, a stylish family bathroom and a second living retreat, providing valuable separation and flexibility for growing families.

Premium appointments include oak flooring, designer lighting, Daikin reverse-cycle heating and cooling with smart zoning, a security alarm and camera system, water tank and storage shed.

Moments from Watsonia Village, Watsonia Station, local cafés, parks and community amenities, the property also enjoys future connectivity benefits from the North East Link and planned Suburban Rail Loop North.

A rare opportunity to secure a beautifully finished, turn-key residence offering sophisticated, low-maintenance living in one of Watsonia’s most connected lifestyle locations.

